content:
Generate Conan profile for {{target_platform}}.

Target Details:
- Platform: {{target_platform}}
- Architecture: {{arch}}
- Compiler: {{compiler}} {{compiler_version}}
- Build Type: {{build_type}}

Profile Content:
```
[settings]
os={{os_name}}
arch={{arch}}
compiler={{compiler}}
compiler.version={{compiler_version}}
build_type={{build_type}}

{{#if cppstd}}compiler.cppstd={{cppstd}}{{/if}}
{{#if libcxx}}compiler.libcxx={{libcxx}}{{/if}}

[options]
{{#each options}}
{{this.name}}={{this.value}}
{{/each}}

[buildenv]
{{#each env_vars}}
{{this.name}}={{this.value}}
{{/each}}

[tool_requires]
{{#each tool_requires}}
{{this}}
{{/each}}
```

Save to: {{output_path}}
